              "text": "emigrar — \"to emigrate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nos anos sessenta, o meu avô emigrou para o estrangeiro. In the sixties my grandfather emigrated abroad."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Emigrar is leaving; imigrar is arriving."
